Package: fierce
Version: 1.6.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: git, python
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/mschwager/fierce
Description: DNS reconnaissance tool for locating targets and non-contiguous IP space
 fierce scans DNS servers to enumerate in-scope hosts, uncover wildcard
 entries, and spot non-contiguous IP blocks. Useful during the
 reconnaissance phase to find hidden hosts and adjacent address space
 for a given domain.
